# cards: Miracle Tears powered up by Shaitan revives at full (docs/plan-cards.md 8, revised). As
# test_skill_miracle_tears (Jian knocked out, Flora at 32 knows Miracle Tears), with Flora wearing Shaitan (card 239,
# her slot 0x020B47B6) at 1000 points (0x020B48B2). Expect: Jian's battle HP 0 -> his max (+0x1C, peeked), not a
# tenth; the points 1000 -> 900; the name bar shows the up arrow (mt_list). Run with --save.
include boot_from_save
pin u16 0x020B4780 999
pin u16 0x020B477C 999
pin u16 0x020B464C 0
pin u16 0x020B4650 3
pin u16 0x020B4654 65535
pin u32 0x020B4668 0
pin u32 0x020b4784 60
pin u32 0x020b4788 60
pin u32 0x020b4778 31
poke u8 0x0213ba1e 1
poke u16 0x020b48b2 1000
poke u16 0x020b47b6 239
include warp6
pin u16 0x020B4780 999
pin u16 0x020B477C 999
pin u16 0x020B464C 0
pin u16 0x020B4650 3
pin u16 0x020B4654 65535
pin u32 0x020B4668 0
pin u32 0x020b4784 60
pin u32 0x020b4788 60
pin u32 0x020b4778 31
wait 270
peek u32 0x020B8620 records
battlers
watch u32 0x0228e8e4 flora_mp
watch u32 0x0228e874 jian_hp
watch u16 0x020b48b2 points
peek u32 0x0228e87c jian_max_hp
shot mt_start
press A 8
wait 50
shot mt_cmd
press Right 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 60
press Right 8
wait 50
press Right 8
wait 50
press Down 8
wait 50
shot mt_list
press A 8
wait 60
shot mt_picker
press A 8
wait 30
waituntil u32 0x0228e8e4 40 3000
wait 8
